    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGING - record-launched automation\nLaunching = creating a record in STAGING - AUTOMATIONS (tblpfUeg0wy731PYF).\nThe Airtable Trigger polls every minute on the Created field, the Launch Gate only lets records with an empty Status through, the run stamps Running on the record, mirrors the Verify Emails chain, and stamps Succeeded (rich log) or Failed (error text) on the same record. Error outputs of every throwing node route to Stamp Failed so no run dies leaving Running.",
